{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Fully detach enums and map keys**\n\nThe copy still shares enum instances and every map key. A custom exporter can mutate a stateful enum or mutable key and thereby corrupt cached content or later exporters' records. Normalize enums to JSON scalars and rebuild keys using the mapper's key-serialization semantics; add mutable-enum and mutable-key tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0a8m","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":66,"observation_digest":"399f27c57f40df2170717dca12ab6b4903b8207862a791abb86a0271da0de152","observation_id":"aro_v1_hgpsprl7idpsc4drpxfbfk3lje","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":56,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_3lge37tog2ktbfhdhjkk3uhwp2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
